{'symbol': 'PSX', 'date': '2021-10-27 17:27:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: WEISSLAW LLP INVESTIGATES PHILLIPS 66 PARTNERS LP', 'text': 'NEW YORK, OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEISSLAW LLP\xa0IS INVESTIGATING POSSIBLE BREACHES OF FIDUCIARY DUTY AND OTHER VIOLATIONS OF LAW BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF PHILLIPS 66 PARTNERS LP ("PSXP" OR THE "PARTNERSHIP") (NYSE: PSXP) IN CONNECTION WITH THE PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF PSXP BY PHILLIPS 66 ("PHILLIPS 66") (NYSE: PSX).\xa0 UNDER THE TERMS OF THE MERGER AGREEMENT, EACH OUTSTANDING PSXP COMMON UNITHOLDER WOULD RECEIVE 0.50 SHARES OF PHILLIPS 66 COMMON STOCK FOR EACH PSXP COMMON UNIT THEY HOLD.'}